---
// Component: Inclusions.astro
---
<!-- 5. INCLUSIONS AND PROOF (WIREFRAME BLOCK 5 - SPLIT LAYOUT) -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border-y border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        
        <!-- Checklist Side (Strictly from wireframe block 5) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/50 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/50">
            Installation Standards
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
            What Is Included?
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
            Every installation from CCTV Carindale comes with our full turnkey standard. We leave your property tidy, fully secured, and fully demonstrated.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3 pt-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Property and camera-position assessment:</strong> Confirming optimal height, lighting angles, entry points and roof access routes.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Written scope and itemised quote:</strong> Fixed price upfront with exact hardware models and cable allowances specified.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Camera mounting and concealed cabling where practical:</strong> Heavy-duty UV-rated Cat6 routed internally through ceiling cavities without messy conduit runs.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>NVR, surveillance hard drive and recording setup:</strong> Enterprise WD Purple 24/7 surveillance hard drive configured for continuous recording.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Mobile viewing and alert configuration:</strong> Setup and testing on all family or business smartphones and tablets.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>System demonstration and simple handover guide:</strong> Step-by-step guidance on reviewing history and exporting footage clips for police or insurance.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Workmanship and equipment warranty documentation:</strong> Customer retains 100% master ownership of all login credentials, system recovery details, and written warranty paperwork.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Proof Side: Strategic Field Blueprint & Cabling Standards -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-6">
          <div class="glass-box rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/15 space-y-5 shadow-xl">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 pb-3">
              <div>
                <span class="font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 block">Installation Proof &amp; Standards</span>
                <span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Carindale Security Architecture</span>
              </div>
              <!-- Tab switcher -->
              <div class="inline-flex p-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-xs">
                <button type="button" onclick="setProofTab('blueprint')" id="tab-btn-blueprint" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold bg-blue-600 text-white shadow-sm transition-all">
                  📸 Camera Mount
                </button>
                <button type="button" onclick="setProofTab('rack')" id="tab-btn-rack" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-all">
                  🔌 Tidy Cabling
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Visual Display Container -->
            <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl relative group">
              <!-- Blueprint Image -->
              <div id="proof-view-blueprint" class="aspect-[4/3] relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 flex items-center justify-center">
                <img src="/image8.png" alt="Dahua PTZ security camera mounted on wall bracket with concealed weatherproof cabling" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_28%] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105">
                <div class="absolute bottom-2 left-2 right-2 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-300">
                  <span>// DAHUA PTZ FIELD MOUNT</span>
                  <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">WEATHERPROOF BRACKET</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Tidy Cabling Rack Image -->
              <div id="proof-view-rack" class="aspect-[4/3] relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 hidden items-center justify-center">
                <img src="/cctv-tidy-rack.jpg" alt="Professional tidy NVR data rack installation with zero messy cabling" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105">
                <div class="absolute bottom-2 left-2 right-2 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-emerald-300">
                  <span>// WALL-MOUNT NVR RACK TERMINATION</span>
                  <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">CLEAN TRADES FINISH</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tidy Cabling Guarantee Box -->
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 flex items-center gap-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="text-2xl">⚡</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Our Tidy Cabling Guarantee:</strong>
                <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
                  No messy external conduits or exposed wires across your facade. We terminate neatly into your home entertainment hub or a lockable wall-mount rack cabinet.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
